DIF.

definition: def"
A reversible structural difference between two identified states.

DIF is not Git diff.

Git diff observes textual or byte-level repository change.
DIF is intended to operate through QPS parsing, structural identity,
and semantic navigation.

The intended invariant is:

current == A
    permits transition to B

current == B
    permits transition to A

current matches neither
    refuses mutation

The exact representation and execution mechanism remain under quarry.
";
